<title>ITALY: Italy bond market starts automatic matching Monday.</title>
<headline>Italy bond market starts automatic matching Monday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's MTS government bond secondary market will introduce automatic matching from Monday July 14, the market management committee said.</p>
<p>Under the new anonymous trading system matching offer and demand an operator will no longer know the name of his counterparty.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
